---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Levelled Media"
  description="The terms that govern your use of the Levelled Media website and services."
  pageStyles={`
    .legal-hero {
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-bottom: 96px;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin: 40px 0 12px;
    }

    .legal-content h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .legal-content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--body-text);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .legal-content li {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--body-text);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--dark);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .legal-updated {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--body-text);
    }
  `}
>
  <section class="hero-section hero-section--compact legal-hero" id="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner hero-inner--centered">
      <h1 class="hero-title fade-up">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle fade-up legal-updated">Last updated: 12 September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">

      <h2>Agreement to terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms apply to your use of levelledmedia.com (the "site"), operated by Levelled Media
        ("we", "us", "our"). By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please
        don't use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <p>
        Levelled Media provides website design and local SEO services to local service businesses. The
        site describes our services and lets you enquire, request a free website, or book a call. It is
        provided for general information and does not itself constitute a contract to deliver services.
        Any paid work we carry out for you is governed by a separate proposal or agreement between us,
        which takes priority over these terms for that work.
      </p>

      <h2>Enquiries and bookings</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a form or book a call, you confirm the information you provide is accurate. We
        use it to respond to you and, where relevant, deliver the services you've asked about — see our
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
      </p>

      <h2>No guaranteed outcomes</h2>
      <p>
        Marketing results (such as search rankings, calls, or leads) depend on many factors outside our
        control, including competitors, search engine changes, and your market. Any specific results or
        guarantees mentioned on this site or in our marketing are illustrative only, and any binding
        guarantee applies solely if, and exactly as, set out in a signed service agreement with you.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content, design and branding of this site belong to Levelled Media and may not be copied or
        reused without our permission. Ownership of any website or materials we build for a client is
        set out separately in that client's service agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses third-party tools to power forms, call booking, and demo videos (including
        GoHighLevel/LeadConnector and Zight). Your use of any embedded third-party tool is also subject
        to that provider's own terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided "as is". To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any
        indirect or consequential loss arising from your use of the site. Nothing in these terms limits
        liability that cannot legally be limited.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows when they last changed.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Email us at
        <span id="terms-email-slot">lewis[at]levelledmedia[dot]com</span>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const el = document.getElementById('terms-email-slot');
    if (el) {
      const user = 'lewis';
      const domain = 'levelledmedia.com';
      const link = document.createElement('a');
      link.href = `mailto:${user}@${domain}`;
      link.textContent = `${user}@${domain}`;
      el.replaceWith(link);
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
